{
  "assessment_scope": "Formal M6 milestone Code Review, baseline0bddea4d through frozen d59dcda2 (engineering167c510a). Complete Explore/Research/Learn packages, FU015–018 navigation, all ten dimensions, TG-01/04/05 and TG-FINAL-02 inventory/candidate reconciliation. Other package subjects identify inspected final parity and disposition basis, not a replacement fresh final whole-change review.",
  "change_id": "2026-09-15-skill-simplification",
  "contributors": [
    {
      "id": "codex-implementer",
      "role": "implement"
    }
  ],
  "findings": [],
  "id": "m6-code-review",
  "independence_basis": "Parent /root authored M6 source and evidence after a different support agent supplied preparatory advice. Separate /root/independent_proposal_review did not author or advise the reviewed edits; it independently inspected all twelve support-package files, exact diff, owners, consumer assertions, accepted prior dispositions and final actual archives.",
  "judgment": "approved",
  "limitations": [
    "Semantic scenarios are explicit independent tracing of published instructions/resources, not live customer workflow execution or measured usability. Structural tests and package parity do not independently establish semantic approval.",
    "M1–M5 scoped judgments inform inventory reconciliation but are not retargeted or expanded. Fresh final whole-change Code Review must assess the complete final diff and refresh TG-FINAL-01 producer/consumer semantics after milestone completion.",
    "Route owns M6 work/activity changes. Final original-base validation, independent final review, distinct Verify and any authorized external handoff remain separately owned; this record grants no branch/PR/release readiness."
  ],
  "rationale": [
    "1 Spec alignment / TG-01 — pass. Baseline0bddea4d through engineering167c510a and frozen handoff d59dcda2 contains only Explore step6, Learn repeated load instruction, bounded FU015–018 navigation and owning records. Current exact Skill Design/Delivery approvals retain M6 authority. EXP-SR-01–03 and LRN-SR-01–03 remain realized: Explore now points directly to its existing proportional rule; Learn retains its one exact Resource-map READ while removing the duplicate. No pilot layout is imposed on these packages.",
    "2 Test coverage — pass. Inspected actual OptionalDiscoverySkillContractTests and LearnSkillSimplificationTests continue to exercise standalone artifacts, proportional alternatives, exact resources/shared copies, one session method, exact operations, missing-method stops, confirmation, route identities and narrow result writes. These checks read the same surviving instructions; no deleted substantive assertion or source-reader change is hidden. Current V1 all19 and selected CI passed. A new test that mirrors either sentence change would add no required behavioral protection.",
    "3 Edge cases / TG-04 — pass by independent full-package instruction tracing. Explore with one credible change and status quo follows the same proportional rule without quota filler; option-method/high-impact triggers still add deeper framing/reversibility only when needed. Incidental option consideration creates no explicit artifact claim. Research receives a bounded factual question, distinguishes local sufficiency from needed external evidence and returns qualified findings to the same owner without selecting a direction. Learn explicit session invocation selects LR1 and loads the exact method once; a request with exact session/route/owner result selects LR0 and does not load it. These observations preserve distinct ordinary/alternate paths.",
    "4 Error handling — pass. Explore/Research unsafe, colliding or ambiguous targets stop before replacement; missing required resources or necessary evidence prevent completion. Research conflicting/stale sources lower confidence or block, rather than manufacture certainty. Learn missing/unreadable/escaped/stale/contradictory/mixed method still stops session creation without reconstruction, while untriggered resources do not block LR0. The complete session method retains lowest available collision suffix, absence recheck, complete Frame, no adoption of malformed partial records and matching-only retry. Changed basis creates a new session; mismatched owner results stop route mutation.",
    "5 Architecture and resource ownership — pass. Explore and Research each retain their standalone structural skeleton, common support contract and separately triggered specialist methods. Both discovery copies equal their unchanged canonical shared source. Learn root owns operation/authority/claims, its one session reference owns Frame–Observe–Classify–Route, and LR0 stays root-local. Confirmation allows classification effects only; authoritative destination owners keep mutation/review authority. No shared policy or cross-skill resource ownership changes need consumer reconciliation.",
    "6 Compatibility and improvement/retention — pass. Explore replaces a repeated option instruction with navigation to the full rule, leaving credibility, suitability and no fixed count at one semantic owner. Learn removes duplicate trigger wording beside the immediately following exact Resource map, retaining failure guard and LR0 exemption. Research retention is substantive: decision/question/stop framing, source freshness, experiment controls, calibrated confidence, partial-versus-blocked findings and owner handoff each protect different outcomes; its source/experiment methods and asset remain readily reachable. Public operations, outputs, profile values, optional invocation and storage meaning do not change.",
    "7 Security/privacy — pass. Common discovery policy retains safe exact targets, source attribution and exclusion of secrets/private raw input or machine paths. Research source-use rules and experiment authority remain bounded. Learn sensitive evidence is separated, topic guidance remains subordinate, and result recording cannot poll, invoke or mutate another owner. No support completion or follow-up navigation grants execution, external action or policy adoption.",
    "8 Derived artifact currency / TG-05 and TG-FINAL-02 — pass for actual final candidate. Reviewer independently compared every one of140 canonical package files across all19 skills with both final archives. Codex bytes match; Claude resources and entrypoint bodies match with only declared adapter frontmatter excluded from direct comparison. Both archive hashes equal m6-validation and candidate metadata. Observed candidate log reports default all-mapped-resource clean installs under both adapters. The complete inventory includes resource-free Constitution; no selected-resource exclusion is misrepresented as inventory omission. Fresh package proof supports current bytes, not customer-agent execution or release.",
    "9 Unrelated changes and follow-up scope — pass. FU015–018 add navigation to actual bounded M1/M2/M3/M4/M5/M6 evidence while preserving every open state, accountable/receiving owner and further adoption decision. No count-only closure or blanket conformance appears. Actual M6 source diff changes no validator, asset, shared source, current project governance, active user artifact or other family. Eight changed and eleven retained packages describe this initiative only.",
    "10 Validation evidence — pass within M6. Scoped m6-obligations/m6-validation/integrated-inventory identify current support subjects and full inventory. Root V1 passed all19; V6 log reports all selected checks passed, focused153.75s; fresh full candidate build and default install smoke passed. Reviewer directly checked actual logs, archive identities, complete source/archive parity, shared-copy equality and exact CLI subjects. Existing unchanged reader/package suite evidence remains supporting; no broad rerun or hosted CI claim is invented. Context returned20 of21 selected items; separate full m5-code-review readback supplied the omitted current approved predecessor. All selected current concerns are resolved.",
    "Inventory reconciliation — pass as milestone scope, not replacement final review. Disjoint six-family mapping equals the canonical nineteen names exactly. M1 implement/code-review changed with preserved local recording/core split and current independent M1 assessment. M2 plan/proposal-review changed; proposal/design/design-review/delivery-review retained for their distinct direction, model and package judgment duties. M3 route/verify/pr retained for separate state, final explanation and external handoff ownership. M4 ci-maintenance restores approved nine-assembly selection and direct reader/fence protection; bugfix retains diagnosis/proof/recovery duties. M5 constitution changes project-selected authority and route successor; vision/project-map retain canonical/derived and current-observation responsibilities. M6 explore/learn changes and research retention are independently assessed above. Prior M1–M5 review rationales and exact current statuses support accepted dispositions, not merely name counts. M4 original finding is resolved and its clean rereview applies; root blocker was separately disposed by its reporter.",
    "Scope integration — optional support conclusions return to the existing decision owner and neither amended line alters the M3-traced author/reviewer/plan/implementation/route/Verify/PR output contracts. Existing milestone judgments retain their scoped meaning despite appended evidence-record bytes; no engineering target or prior judgment is retargeted. The final checkpoint must freshly inspect the complete delivered diff and producer/consumer chain after M6 closeout, including missing/stale basis stops, then distinct Verify. This milestone judgment does not supply that fresh holistic assessment."
  ],
  "reviewer": {
    "id": "independent-m6-review",
    "role": "review"
  },
